	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<case "why_town">>
	<<set $averySeen.pushUnique("why_town")>>
	"What brought me here?" Avery hums. "It's a reasonable question, I suppose. After all, this town
	<<if $averyragerevealed gte 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte 20>>
		is utter rubbish.
	<<else>>
