	<</if>>
	But..." <<He>> plays with the stem of <<his>> glass, watching the wine swirl inside it. "That's why I came. We all want someplace to call our own, don't we? If I help save this town from itself, well." <<He>> smirks. "I could make it mine."
	<br><br>
	After a moment, <<he>> looks back up at you, and smiles. "And what about you?" <<he>> asks. "What do you think about this town?"
